comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-12T11:23:56.804Z",codex-sol,"Behavioral revert proof: removing the replay check inside decide makes node --test --test-name-pattern=\"apply writes only synthetic\" test/core.test.ts fail because the repeat application posts a duplicate reply. Restored byte-for-byte. All remote write fixtures are synthetic."
  "2026-10-12T13:22:58.767Z",codex-sol,Review round 1 confirms pending --apply can reply and resolve a thread. Reject before local or remote writes; retain local pending verdict support.
  "2026-10-12T13:30:30.992Z",codex-sol,"Finding 4248463316: pending --apply rejects before transport reads or tracker writes; local pending remains supported. node --test --test-name-pattern=\"pending apply fails\" test/core.test.ts passes with a real tracker; reverting only the pending guard fails (exit 1)."
